  "comments": "<p>Curiosity<br>(1) <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ef%C3%ADgie_da_Rep%C3%BAblica\"><i>Effigy of the Republic</i></a><br><br>(2) <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaguar\"><i>Jaguar (Panthera onca)</i></a><br>---<br><strong>Notes</strong><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5eaf4cc1a0fd1.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5eaf4cc1a0fd1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><i>more...</i> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.numista.com/numisdoc/brazil-179.html\">Federative Republic of <strong>Brazil</strong></a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brazilian_real\">Real (R$)</a><br>---<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5eafd27f2a523.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5eafd27f2a523.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><i><strong>Important:</strong> Date is frozen on 2010 (release of the new banknote series)</i><br>---<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5eb0e075cbccf.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5eb0e075cbccf.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><i>Tactile mark for the visually impaired</i><br>---<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5eb0e0459e1ef.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5eb0e0459e1ef.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5eb0e055e70c5.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5eb0e055e70c5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><i>Specimen note sample</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is a security strip which can be read under backlight. It has “50 REAIS” repeated on it, seen here on a 2019 note:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/68186a16ba897.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/68186a16ba897.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>UV activity on a 2019 note, at 365nm:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/68186a5d2ba59.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/68186a5d2ba59.jpg\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/68186a6454991.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/68186a6454991.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Brandon Bertolli</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Location of hidden latent images on the banknote:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1.) On the obverse side, in the large orange/brown space to the right of of the sculpture, the denomination “50” can be seen when the note is tilted or looked at closely.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/684630901698d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/684630901698d.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Kiet Tran</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2.) On the reverse side, in the bush to the left of the smaller jaguar, the denomination “50” can be seen when the note is tilted or looked at closely.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/684630f40019f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/684630f40019f.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Kiet Tran</p>",
